        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(b) Guaranteed Pension Formula: The pension under the Guaranteed Pension Formula is $30 per month per year of union benefit service with E.A.S.T., Local 1553 effective July 1, 2005, and $31 per month per year of union benefit service effective July 1, 2006. The pension is calculated under the Guaranteed Pension Formula for any member of this union who was employed by Raytheon on or after May 23, 2005.",
